WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.566
Hi, I'm Abderrahman.

00:00:01.904 --> 00:00:04.971
Welcome to Kotlin Programming with IntelliJ IDEA,

00:00:05.149 --> 00:00:07.820
where you'll write concise, null-safe Kotlin.

00:00:08.138 --> 00:00:09.242
And this is Rodrigo.

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:11.512
He'll teach you lambdas and collections,

00:00:11.524 --> 00:00:14.198
coroutines, and how Kotlin works with Java.
